Error [E3401]: `read_first` calls the impure function `io.stdin`
  --> tests/ui/stdin_pure_e3401.jet:5:18
    |
  5 |     handle :: io.stdin()
    |                  ^^^^^
 Why: `io.stdin` is impure, but `read_first` declares `=[]=>`
 Fix: give `io.stdin` an explicit `=[]=>` bound, or remove the call from `read_first`
